!!! oculus/scene.mat
!!! The semantic scene — ordered collection of scene nodes with revision tracking.
!!!
!!! A scene is a bounded, revisioned projection of the desktop state.
!!! It tracks the canonical node list, parentage, and revision identity.

book oculus.scene

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.identity
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.role
read everything from oculus.window.focus
read everything from oculus.scene.node

scene begin record
    field revision as override long
    field nodes as text
end record
